Shopkeeper: Ah, another farmer!

Shopkeeper: If you've got a good harvest, I've got Gold.

Shopkeeper: Sell what you don't need.
Shopkeeper: A full barn won't help you if your pockets are empty.

Shopkeeper: Harvestia needs more than crops to recover.
Shopkeeper: We need people who are willing to work for its future.

Shopkeeper: So keep farming, keep selling...
Shopkeeper: and keep that Gold coming.

